				<r3d:description language="eng">INRAE is the world’s first organisation specialized on agricultural, food and environmental sciences. Data INRAE is offered by INRAE as part of its mission to open the results of its research.
Data INRAE will share research data in relation with food, nutrition, agriculture and environment. It includes experimental, simulation and observation data, omic data, survey and text data.
Only data produced by or in collaboration with INRAE will be hosted in the repository, but anyone can access the metadata and the open data.</r3d:description>
